    "sections": {
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin as a ZIP file</li>\n<li>Go to “Plugins” &gt; “Add New” &gt; “Upload Plugin”</li>\n<li>Activate it</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20keep%20specific%20feeds%20active%3F'>\nCan I keep specific feeds active?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Not in this version. We&#8217;re working on a UI to let you choose which feeds to disable.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "description": "<p>Disable all RSS/Atom feeds on your site. Lightweight, fast, and ideal for SEO and privacy. No configuration required.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Blocks all RSS, RSS2, Atom, and RDF feeds</li>\n<li>Displays a custom message to the user</li>\n<li>Lightweight, no admin settings required</li>\n</ul>\n"
